<p><em>[A hallway leads to a small room, the source of the music. The floor and walls of the area are covered in cassette tapes, as well as mediums with which to read and write onto them. A default native entity is seated in the center of the room, typing on a Commodore 64. The tag above their head reads &quot;<a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/gamers-against-weed-dossier">MxMasters</a>&quot;.]</em></p>
