<p><strong>MxMasters:</strong> <em>[Voice is estimated to belong to that of a young teenager, approximately twelve to fourteen years of age. They do not turn to face STF Omicron-4 when speaking.]</em> What? Oh. It's fine. Knock yourself out.</p>
